      <data key="d5">"acting career, milestone"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0369</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YURIY SARANTSEV&quot;" target="&quot;LONDON&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Yuriy Sarantsev has lived and worked in London, becoming an adopted homeland for him, and expressing deep gratitude towards the city for the opportunities it has provided."</data>
      <data key="d5">"gratitude, adopted homeland"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0369</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;YURIY SARANTSEV&quot;" target="&quot;UNITED KINGDOM OF GREAT BRITAIN AND IRELAND&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland has provided Yuriy Sarantsev with opportunities and a sense of belonging, symbolizing his integration into British society."</data>
      <data key="d5">"opportunities, sense of belonging"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0369</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNITED KINGDOM OF GREAT BRITAIN AND IRELAND&quot;" target="&quot;YURIY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Yuriy feels a deep sense of pride and gratitude towards the United Kingdom, indicating a strong emotional and personal connection."</data>
      <data key="d5">"gratitude, opportunity"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0369</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNITED KINGDOM OF GREAT BRITAIN AND IRELAND&quot;" target="&quot;OPPORTUNITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland provided the opportunities that Yuriy values, emphasizing the direct link between the country and the opportunities."</data>
      <data key="d5">"opportunity provider, gratitude"</data>
